# A fifth Russian story: read it all yourself
subtitle: "Read Masha's longest note yet, written on her way to see her brother in Oslo and built only from lessons 1–49, page by page, hear it line by line, test what you understood, and look back at the first fifty lessons, the halfway mark."
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"A fifth story: read it all yourself\" note \"lessons 1–49, 12 lines\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Talking about things in Russian: о маме, о работе","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/51-russian-about.cast"}

## A fifth Russian story: read it all yourself
level: basic
heading: false

    glossed s1 "Приве́т! Сего́дня я лечу́ в О́сло." gloss ["hi","today","I","fly","to","Oslo"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Там живёт мой брат Ива́н." gloss ["there","lives","my","brother","Ivan"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s3 "За́втра Ива́ну бу́дет два́дцать три го́да!" gloss ["tomorrow","to Ivan","will be","twenty","three","years"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s4 "В О́сло сего́дня хо́лодно и идёт снег." gloss ["in","Oslo","today","cold","and","goes","snow"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Пото́м я е́ду на по́езде на вокза́л." gloss ["then","I","ride","by","train","to","station"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s6 "Гости́ница бли́зко: пря́мо, пото́м нале́во." gloss ["hotel","near","straight on","then","left"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s7 "Я дарю́ бра́ту кни́гу: он лю́бит чита́ть." gloss ["I","give","to brother","book","he","loves","to read"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s8 "Ива́н написа́л мне: «Дава́й пойдём в теа́тр!»" gloss ["Ivan","wrote","to me","let's","go","to","theatre"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s9 "Мы идём в суббо́ту в семь часо́в." gloss ["we","go","on","Saturday","at","seven","o'clock"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s10 "Ива́н игра́ет на гита́ре, и я то́же." gloss ["Ivan","plays","on","guitar","and","I","too"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s11 "Он игра́ет лу́чше, чем я!" gloss ["he","plays","better","than","I"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
