    grid grid gap 16 columns 1 fit.h 520 fit.w 860 fit.x 70 fit.y 160 hidden true

A: Masha is on a plane, and she has written you her longest note yet.
    draw open_woman

A: Can you read it all on your own?
    draw open_plane

    erase open_woman open_plane

A: Twelve lines, and every word comes from lessons one to forty-nine. Read each page first, and tap any word you're unsure of.
    draw s1 s2 s3

B: Приве́т! Сего́дня я лечу́ в О́сло.
    highlight s1_words color #c9871a

B: Там живёт мой брат Ива́н.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

B: За́втра Ива́ну бу́дет два́дцать три го́да!
    highlight s3_words color #c9871a

A: Я лечу́ в О́сло: I'm flying to Oslo. Лечу́ is for a plane, from lesson forty-seven, and О́сло never changes.
    highlight s1_w_4 s1_w_5 s1_w_6 color #c9871a

B: Ива́ну бу́дет два́дцать три го́да: Ivan will be twenty-three. Ива́ну has the to-ending у of lesson forty-five, and три takes го́да, as in lesson twenty-nine.
    highlight s3_w_2 color #8a5fa8 part у$ effect pulse

    erase s1 s2 s3

    draw s4 s5 s6

B: В О́сло сего́дня хо́лодно и идёт снег.
    highlight s4_words color #c9871a

B: Пото́м я е́ду на по́езде на вокза́л.
    highlight s5_words color #c9871a

B: Гости́ница бли́зко: пря́мо, пото́м нале́во.
    highlight s6_words color #c9871a

B: Хо́лодно и идёт снег: it's cold, and it's snowing, from lesson thirty-three. In Russian, snow goes.
    highlight s4_w_4 s4_w_5 s4_w_6 s4_w_7 color #c9871a

A: Е́ду на по́езде: I ride by train. Something carries her, so е́ду, and на по́езде has the е of lesson forty-seven.
    highlight s5_w_5 color #d0865f part е$ effect pulse

B: And from the station: пря́мо, пото́м нале́во. Straight on, then left, from lesson forty-two.
    highlight s6_w_3 s6_w_4 s6_w_5 color #c9871a

    erase s4 s5 s6

    draw s7 s8 s9

B: Я дарю́ бра́ту кни́гу: он лю́бит чита́ть.
    highlight s7_words color #c9871a

B: Ива́н написа́л мне: «Дава́й пойдём в теа́тр!»
    highlight s8_words color #c9871a

B: Мы идём в суббо́ту в семь часо́в.
    highlight s9_words color #c9871a

A: Я дарю́ бра́ту кни́гу: I'm giving my brother a book. Бра́ту, who gets it, has the to-ending у of lesson forty-five…
    highlight s7_w_3 color #8a5fa8 part у$ effect pulse

B: …and кни́гу, what he gets, has lesson fourteen's object у. Two endings, two jobs.
    highlight s7_w_4 color #3f7d4e part у$ effect pulse

A: Написа́л: he wrote it, and it's done. The done verb of lesson forty-four, with на in front.
    highlight s8_w_2 color #2a7f86 part ^на effect pulse

B: Дава́й пойдём в теа́тр: let's go to the theatre. Then the when, as in lesson forty-six: в суббо́ту, в семь часо́в.
    highlight s8_w_4 s8_w_5 s8_w_6 s8_w_7 s9_w_3 s9_w_4 s9_w_5 s9_w_6 s9_w_7 color #c9871a

    erase s7 s8 s9

    draw s10 s11 s12

B: Ива́н игра́ет на гита́ре, и я то́же.
    highlight s10_words color #c9871a

B: Он игра́ет лу́чше, чем я!
    highlight s11_words color #c9871a

B: А куда́ ты е́дешь ле́том? Пока́!
    highlight s12_words color #c9871a

A: Игра́ет на гита́ре: he plays the guitar. An instrument takes на, from lesson forty-eight.
    highlight s10_w_2 s10_w_3 s10_w_4 color #c9871a

B: Он игра́ет лу́чше, чем я: he plays better than I do. Лу́чше and чем, from lesson forty-three.
    highlight s11_w_3 s11_w_4 s11_w_5 color #c9871a

A: And last: куда́ ты е́дешь ле́том? Where are you going in summer? Masha is asking you.
    highlight s12_words color #c9871a

    erase s10 s11 s12

    quiz "Где живёт Ива́н? Where does Ivan live? Pick one." frame true reveal.text "Ива́н живёт в О́сло." reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1 pool false
        intro: Now five questions on the note, from memory.
        right: In Oslo: Masha is flying there to see him.
        wrong: Masha is flying to see him. Where to?
        * в Москве́
        * в Ло́ндоне
        + в О́сло

    erase question_1_stamp

    quiz "How old will Ivan be tomorrow? Pick one." frame true reveal.text "Два́дцать три го́да!" reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1 pool false
        right: Twenty-three: tomorrow is his birthday.
        wrong: Thirty-one is Tom, and twenty-two was last year.
        + Два́дцать три го́да.
        * Два́дцать два го́да.
        * Три́дцать оди́н год.

    erase question_2_stamp

    ask "In Oslo, Masha takes the train. Type the missing word: Я е́ду на …" frame true answer ["поезде"] reveal.text "Я е́ду на по́езде." reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: По́езде: на, and the е that says what carries you.
        wrong: Start from по́езд, and add the е of на вокза́ле.

    erase question_3_stamp

    quiz "How does Masha get from the station to the hotel? Pick one." frame true reveal.text "Пря́мо, пото́м нале́во." reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1 pool false
        right: Straight on, then left.
        wrong: First straight on. Then look at the middle of the word: ле is left.
        * Нале́во, пото́м пря́мо.
        * Пря́мо, пото́м напра́во.
        + Пря́мо, пото́м нале́во.

    erase question_4_stamp

    quiz "Masha gives her brother a book: Я дарю́ … кни́гу. Which word fills the gap?" frame true reveal.text "Я дарю́ бра́ту кни́гу." reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Бра́ту: the one who gets the present takes у.
        wrong: Брат gets the present: which ending says to?
        * брат
        + бра́ту
        * бра́та

    erase question_5_stamp

    draw score_woman

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_woman

    draw grid

A: Fifty lessons: the halfway mark of the course. Look back: you started with the letters, then said hello, ordered in a café, and asked what things cost.
    highlight U1 U2 color #c9871a

B: You gave your name and said where you live, then told what you did yesterday and what you will do tomorrow.
    highlight U3 U4 color #c9871a

B: And now you can get by: ask again, find the way, make a plan and take a train. Masha's note took words from all five blocks of ten, and not one of them was new.
    highlight U5 color #c9871a

    erase grid

A: Masha asked you where you're going in summer, so answer her out loud.
    draw end_woman

A: Ле́том я е́ду в…, and a place: в Москву́, в Ло́ндон.
    draw end_text end_hint

B: Счастли́вого пути́! Have a good trip, as I said in the travel lesson.
    draw end_party

    erase end_woman end_text end_hint end_party

A: The course goes on. Next: the cases, completed, starting with о ма́ме, about mum.
    draw next51

B: Пока́! See you in lesson fifty-one.
    highlight next51 color #c9871a

